**`RevenueTable` / `CutChoiceTable` → private inner classes of `RodCuttingSolver`**
These were solver implementation details that had no business being visible to the rest of the codebase. Their standalone `.java` files are deleted; they now live as `private static` classes inside `RodCuttingSolver`.

